 Palace","shared_categories":"Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"solZespjuuKYogZQHvXEGQ","review_id":"4ZW5Pmn-Hml3o_cCjZ8IRw","date":"2017-06-16T16:52:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482392072677612,"text_excerpt":"Came here for lunch with a friend - such a good spot and I'll definitely be back. Given the type of food and the vibe, I definitely expected higher pricing, but it's incredibly reasonably priced. My friend had the Supreme Avocado Toast which she really enjoyed. I had the Rainbow Bowl which is vegan (they told me they can make anything on the menu except for one dressing which has honey - I loved that they were so knowledgeable about what's in their food!). It was really good and really filling. We then split a vegan cookie s'mores donut from Midnight Noodle that they have on the counter. That was INCREDIBLE. It's all veggie, but my very omnivore boyfriend looked at the menu and asked to c..."},{"business_id":"solZespjuuKYogZQHvXEGQ","review_id":"i43fVVgrw58kRe9P37_UMg","date":"2017-11-08T05:04:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9453586935997009,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! It's located near the smoothie King center and a bunch of other restaurants like Willa Jean, company burger, etc. Parking is a pain because you have to pay for the meter, but that's common in this area. Order at the counter and they will bring the food to you. They have so many healthy, meat free options such as salads, toasts, smoothies and grain bowls. I've opted for the bowls each time. They are chock fill of flavor and texture. I got the morning bowl this time which had quinoa, an egg, veggies, avocado in a delicious dressing that was light, yet filling without feeling disgusting afterwards. They have daily lemonades and other drinks along with pressed juices. Definit..."},{"business_id":"solZespjuuKYogZQHvXEGQ","review_id":"aaOgzLl8nNHOMyjyzvMmAA","date":"2017-09-22T15:03:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9378231763839722,"text_excerpt":"I am far from being a vegetarian or vegan cause a sista loves her bacon, but I do love my veggies. So when my friend and I stumbled here for lunch the other week, I was able to find plenty to choose from. The space itself is so bright and airy and welcoming. I think it is a great addition to the area if your looking for healthy options. I initially wanted avocado toast cause I love me some Leo's bread, but having just completed an exercise class, I opted for a salad. I was craving a chicken salad, but I tell u after I finished it I didn't even miss the meat! I ordered the Mexicali blues salad and devoured that thing. Everything was so fresh on the salad and the dressing was perfect! I sam..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"solZespjuuKYogZQHvXEGQ","photo_id":"Dlo8Fh32KFlaeJ7gPM4CPQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Dlo8Fh32KFlaeJ7gPM4CPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9301716089248657},{"business_id":"solZespjuuKYogZQHvXEGQ","photo_id":"FE